# 用法：启动 Demo1Application 后，按顺序从上往下点 ▶ 执行（也可以点顶部的 Run All）
# 注意：数据库是 H2 内存库，应用每次重启数据都会清空，所以每次都要先跑“注册”
# 注意：除了“添加书籍”，别的接口都不需要管理员

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 注册普通用户 xiaoming（isAdmin = false）
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/signUp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": {
    "name": "小明",
    "username": "xiaoming",
    "password": "123456",
    "isAdmin": false
  }
}

### 2. 注册管理员 admin（isAdmin = true）—— 添加书籍必须用它
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/signUp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": {
    "name": "管理员",
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "123456",
    "isAdmin": true
  }
}

### 3. 测试登录（普通用户）
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/signIn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": {
    "username": "xiaoming",
    "password": "123456"
  }
}

### 4. 添加书籍 —— 用管理员，应该成功（code = 200）
# 注意：这里故意不传 id，id 由数据库自动生成
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book": {
    "name": "C++Design",
    "author": "xiaoming",
    "stock": 1,
    "price": 100.00
  },
  "user": {
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "123456"
  }
}

### 5. 再添加一本同名的书 —— 应该失败（《C++Design》已经存在了）
# 需要先成功执行第 4 个请求
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book": {
    "name": "C++Design",
    "author": "别人",
    "stock": 5,
    "price": 88.00
  },
  "user": {
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "123456"
  }
}

### 6. 换本新书再添加 —— 应该成功（确认不是只有第一本能加）
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book": {
    "name": "深入理解JVM",
    "author": "周志明",
    "stock": 10,
    "price": 79.00
  },
  "user": {
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "123456"
  }
}

### 7. 普通用户加书 —— 应该失败（不是管理员，无权操作）
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book": {
    "name": "普通用户加的书",
    "author": "小明",
    "stock": 1,
    "price": 10.00
  },
  "user": {
    "username": "xiaoming",
    "password": "123456"
  }
}

### 8. 密码故意填错 —— 应该失败（密码错误）
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book": {
    "name": "密码错的书",
    "author": "谁",
    "stock": 1,
    "price": 10.00
  },
  "user": {
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "错的密码"
  }
}

### 9. 用户不存在 —— 应该失败（用户不存在）
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book": {
    "name": "幽灵加的书",
    "author": "谁",
    "stock": 1,
    "price": 10.00
  },
  "user": {
    "username": "ghost",
    "password": "123456"
  }
}

### 10. 库存填负数 —— 应该失败（库存不能为空，也不能是负数）
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book": {
    "name": "库存负数的书",
    "author": "谁",
    "stock": -1,
    "price": 10.00
  },
  "user": {
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "123456"
  }
}

### 11. 价格填 0 —— 应该失败（价格必须大于 0）
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book": {
    "name": "价格为零的书",
    "author": "谁",
    "stock": 1,
    "price": 0
  },
  "user": {
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "123456"
  }
}

### 12. 书名是空字符串 —— 应该失败（书名不能为空）
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book": {
    "name": "   ",
    "author": "谁",
    "stock": 1,
    "price": 10.00
  },
  "user": {
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "123456"
  }
}

### 13. 前端自己传 id —— 应该成功，但 id 会被忽略，不会覆盖已有的书
# 验证方法：执行完后可以用 H2 控制台查 select * from books，id 是新生成的，不是 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book": {
    "id": 1,
    "name": "id被忽略的书",
    "author": "谁",
    "stock": 3,
    "price": 20.00
  },
  "user": {
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "123456"
  }
}

### 14. 查询所有图书 —— 应该成功，返回前面加进去的那几本
# 想看到"当前还没有图书"，就重启应用（内存库清空）后只跑这一个请求
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/all

### 15. 按 id 查书 —— 应该成功（id = 1 是第 4 步加的 C++Design）
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1

### 16. 查一个不存在的 id —— 应该失败（书籍不存在）
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/999

### 17. 请求里没带密码 —— 应该失败（账号或密码不能为空）
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book": {
    "name": "没带密码的书",
    "author": "谁",
    "stock": 1,
    "price": 10.00
  },
  "user": {
    "username": "admin"
  }
}

